WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:03.159
"What? Rocket Girl is here?"

2
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.073
Tanya Tidy looked over at the window.

3
00:00:06.074 --> 00:00:08.960
"It's time for us to go, cleaning crew!"

4
00:00:08.961 --> 00:00:13.011
"You're not going anywhere, Tanya!" Roxy cried.

5
00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:16.954
She shot outside and landed in front of the cleaners.

6
00:00:16.955 --> 00:00:20.198
"You're not a real cleaning service," Roxy said.

7
00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:23.939
"You're a bunch of dirty thieves who steal from customers!

8
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:27.205
And I'm not going to let you get away with it."

9
00:00:27.206 --> 00:00:31.693
Tanya grinned. "We'll see about that, Rocket Girl!"

10
00:00:31.694 --> 00:00:36.259
She snapped her fingers, and the crew members grabbed mops.

11
00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:39.323
They surrounded Roxy, twirling their mops.

12
00:00:39.324 --> 00:00:45.320
Roxy gulped. "I don't think these mops just scrub floors!" she thought.

13
00:00:45.321 --> 00:00:48.913
One cleaner swung his mop at her. Boom!

14
00:00:48.914 --> 00:00:50.805
She blocked the blow.

15
00:00:50.806 --> 00:00:53.987
Another tried to bring her mop down hard on Roxy's head.

16
00:00:53.988 --> 00:00:58.575
Roxy grabbed the mop's handle and snapped it in half. Crack!

17
00:00:58.576 --> 00:01:03.054
Bam! Bam! Roxy kicked and punched the cleaning crew.

18
00:01:03.055 --> 00:01:04.864
Two fell to the ground.

19
00:01:04.865 --> 00:01:07.607
A third cleaner pressed a button on his mop.

20
00:01:07.608 --> 00:01:11.369
The handle grew longer, and the string mophead punched the air.

21
00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:16.626
Pow! Pow! Pow! The cleaner aimed the mop at Roxy.

22
00:01:16.627 --> 00:01:21.930
She tried to dodge the mophead, but it hit her in the face. Pow!

23
00:01:21.931 --> 00:01:24.681
"Oof!" Roxy was knocked to the ground.

24
00:01:24.682 --> 00:01:27.340
She was starting to get up when she noticed something. There

25
00:01:27.341 --> 00:01:31.346
was a bucket near the man's feet. Roxy

26
00:01:31.347 --> 00:01:34.161
grabbed it and dunked it over his head. "Aah!"

27
00:01:34.162 --> 00:01:38.263
the cleaner cried, stumbling around with the bucket on his head. "This

28
00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:42.337
bucket is stuck on my head!" "Okay,

29
00:01:42.338 --> 00:01:46.696
Rocket Girl!" Tanya Tidy glared at Roxy. "You

30
00:01:46.697 --> 00:01:48.913
asked for it!" "Asked

31
00:01:48.914 --> 00:01:52.228
for what?" Roxy said. "My

32
00:01:52.229 --> 00:01:55.493
most special service," Tanya said. "A

33
00:01:55.494 --> 00:02:00.906
deep clean using Tanya Tidy's Tornado XL!" Beside

34
00:02:00.907 --> 00:02:02.999
Tanya, there was a machine. It

35
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.259
looked like a vacuum with a big tub. It

36
00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:07.729
also had an enormous hose. She

37
00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:10.643
spun around to flip a switch. Whoosh!

38
00:02:10.644 --> 00:02:14.683
The machine turned on with a loud sucking noise. Grabbing

39
00:02:14.684 --> 00:02:20.549
the giant hose, two cleaners rushed at Roxy. As

40
00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:24.862
the powerful suction hit, Roxy's cape blew up. Then

41
00:02:24.863 --> 00:02:28.550
she could feel her feet starting to slide along the ground. "Uh-oh!"

42
00:02:28.551 --> 00:02:30.680
Roxy cried. The

43
00:02:30.681 --> 00:02:32.786
machine was pulling her toward it. "I

44
00:02:32.787 --> 00:02:38.659
have super breath. This thing has super suction!" She

45
00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.687
waved her arms, trying to fly away. Tanya

46
00:02:41.688 --> 00:02:46.079
laughed loudly. "It

47
00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:51.236
looks like Tanya Tidy's Tornado XL is too strong for you!" Roxy

48
00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:54.712
yelped as she was pulled towards the vacuum's hose. It

49
00:02:54.713 --> 00:02:57.381
opened wider. Then,

50
00:02:57.382 --> 00:03:07.310
with another loud whoosh , it sucked her inside!

